<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32785" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπτύω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύσομαι <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span></span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			5.196
		</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
			Mel.
		</span></i>) :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spit out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στόματος δ᾽ ἐξέπτυσεν ἅλμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.322
				</span></i>
			, cf. <u>AP</u>l.c. ; of the sea, <i>cast up,</i>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.224
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Theodorid.
			</span></i>) : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ χαλινὸν τὸν λόγον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.328c
				</span></i>
			 ; so, of a ligature, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.24.7
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			) ; <i>spit</i> or <i>blab out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόρρητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					4.44
				</span></i>
			 ; of an abortion, ib.<i><span class="en">
				12.17
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>spit</i> in token of disgust, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				792
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>spit at, abominate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Gal.
				4.14
			</span></i>.</div>
